  "bodyHash": "f18ac26efa6d7c5c",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:60px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2274\" height=\"749\"></p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote style=\"padding-left:20px;font-style:italic;color:#666\">\n<p>&laquo;受夠了《我的世界》基本的用戶介面嗎？厭倦了每次靠近附魔台卻只能看到跟工作台一樣的灰色選單嗎？想要為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？</p>\n<p>隆重介紹「彩色容器」！一款容器 GUI 替換模組，希望能讓選單與《我的世界》中各種色彩繽紛的可互動方塊相匹配。」</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:normal\">現在，我帶來了完全<strong>重</strong>新製作、<strong>重</strong>新紋理、<strong>重</strong>新構思的版本 &ndash;&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#d32927\">R</span><span style=\"color:#e66826\">e</span><span style=\"color:#ec9222\">c</span><span style=\"color:#eab718\">o</span><span style=\"color:#cbd541\">l</span><span style=\"color:#86e441\">o</span><span style=\"color:#7bd6c8\">u</span><span style=\"color:#419be5\">r</span><span style=\"color:#3777e0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#8665e0\">u</span><span style=\"color:#c76ee4\">l </span>Containers</strong>，支援新版本、全新紋理，以及更強的沉浸感！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\">所有 GUI 介面皆根據其所關聯的方塊靈感進行改動。修復了原版《我的世界》紋理、調整了 HUD 顯示，甚至包含原版中的動畫 GUI，還有更多更多<strong>驚喜！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:normal\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><strong>變更紋理圖示：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>變更紋理清單：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>鐵砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>煉藥鍋</li>\n<li>織布機</li>\n<li>製圖台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>磨石</li>\n<li>鍛造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>製造機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投擲器、發射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔爐、高爐、煙燻爐&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>帶箱子的船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>帶箱子的礦車</li>\n<li>鸚鵡螺與僵尸鸚鵡螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品欄</li>\n<li>配方書</li>\n<li>書</li>\n<li>信標</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>經驗條&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>部分小型 UI 調整與修復</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」功能</span></strong>（請閱讀「安裝指南」以獲取更多資訊）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>帶有職業的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>末影箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>馬、不死馬、僵尸馬</li>\n<li>駱駝、騾子、驢、羊駝</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 專屬功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>所有類型與職業組合的村民 GUI（OptiGUI 專屬）&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>聖誕節箱子</li>\n<li>帶有變體的銅箱子 <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潛影盒</li>\n<li>馬、不死馬、僵尸馬</li>\n<li>駱駝、騾子、驢（含與不含箱子版本 - <em>OptiGUI 專屬</em>）</li>\n<li>羊駝（含地毯配色）</li>\n<li>輕微損壞、嚴重損壞的鐵砧 <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>已撰寫的書 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 專屬)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>講台上的書 <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組相容性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>(OptiGUI 專屬)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To</li>\n<li>Horseman</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">若欲體驗完整功能，必須安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine！</h3>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或僅使用 OptiFine 模組，您可以在語言設定中啟用內建的<span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式</h3>\n<p>啟用方式：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需其他語言支援，請從主檔案下方的<span style=\"color:#f16131\">「其他檔案」</span>標籤頁下載獨立的 VANILLA+ 套件</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge_additional_files.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"150\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p><strong>常見問題與解答：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>問：我可以哪裡詢問任何問題（不在本清單內的）？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>留言或加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recolourful Discord 伺服器</a>並在那裡提問！</p>\n<p><strong>已知問題清單：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>搭配 OptiFine 時：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民職業功能無法運作</li>\n<li>木桶會顯示箱子的 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>帶箱子的船會顯示最後瀏覽過的類似箱子的容器 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>部分馬類生物不支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若僅使用 OptiFine，建議啟用<span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>搭配<span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式時：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>在 1.21.9+ 版本重新命名後，潛影盒不會顯示彩色 GUI</li>\n<li>潛影盒欄位高亮顯示異常 / 部分版本無法顯示</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>問：箱子／潛影盒／村民職業的 GUI 無法運作！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請確認您是否已安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或是否已將語言切換為<span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：你能新增對 X 模組的支援嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>簡短回答：理論上可以。請在留言區留下您的建議或在 Discord 提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 嗎？／我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 嗎？／我可以對 Recolourful Containers 進行 X 操作嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請參閱描述檔底部的「使用條款」</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我想支持你！我該怎麼做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>關於這件事&hellip;</p>\n</div>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果您不想架設伺服器但仍想支持我，<strong>請將此套件分享給朋友，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等任何平台展示！</strong>只需留下此頁面的連結即可，我會非常感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>別忘了按讚並追蹤，以便獲得未來更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"54\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fchris_xeno%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 提供其原始的「彩色容器」紋理套件</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 協助編寫自訂着色器程式碼，許多功能得以實現皆多虧了他</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kryqu/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kryqu</a></strong> 提供村民 GUI 的設計靈感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><strong>使用條款：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>如果您認為自己無法對本套件進行某項操作，請事先與我聯繫 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>將此套件納入免費的整合包中</li>\n<li>將此套件用於您的私人伺服器</li>\n<li>修改此套件（僅限個人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何媒體形式中使用此套件，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未經我同意，不得以任何形式在任何平台上分發此套件、其資源檔或修改後的資源檔</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
